# This fixture tests tagged-flow plane separation only.
# ControlSource.out is intentionally left unconsumed; the resulting
# orphan-outputs Warning is benign because scoring counts only Error-severity
# diagnostics. TaskSink { _is_output: true } satisfies output-reachability
# so this clean graph is genuinely Green.
src = ControlSource
sink = TaskSink { _is_output: true }
